  "notes": "Malay uses Malaysian administrative register rather than a literal gloss: subsidi bersasar / rasionalisasi subsidi, warta kerajaan for gazetting, sebut harga alongside tender, mekanisme apungan terurus for managed-float pricing, and levi keuntungan luar jangka for the windfall levy. Movement carries meN-/di-/peN--an triads because headlines swap freely between active, passive and nominalised forms. Kept 'kelulusan' (approval) in movement and 'kelulusan bersyarat' in instrument to avoid a duplicate."
